<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan lowers interest rate on dlr certificates.</title>
<headline>Pakistan lowers interest rate on dlr certificates.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan reduced interest rates for March on five-year foreign currency bearer certificates on Friday.</p>
<p>Here are the new rates:</p>
<p> Currency	     March 1-31	   February 1-28</p>
<p> U.S. dollar	  8.75		   9.00 percent P.A.</p>
<p> Pound sterling     9.25		   9.75 percent P.A.</p>
<p> Deutsche mark	6.75		   7.00 percent P.A.</p>
<p> Japanese yen	 4.00		   4,00 percent P.A.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
